{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Look what the mouse dragged in!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click and drag to cast your <strong>Spell Box</strong> and capture waves of <strong>Draggins</strong>, but be careful! Your <strong>Spell Box</strong> is vulnerable to attacks. Dodge, weave, and swoop in for tactical blows, all while strategizing your ideal build.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover new types of <strong>Draggins</strong> in each locale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn <strong>Spells</strong> and drink <strong>Potions</strong> to power up as the challenge intensifies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/DragBoxes.gif?t=1751241347\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It just keeps draggin' on!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover new builds and strategies with each run while overcoming <strong>Challenges</strong> to earn <strong>Spells</strong> and <strong>Outfits</strong>. Change the way you play as you strive for higher heights and get Margot some fresh fits!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ <strong>Challenges</strong> to hunt with each run for some sweet rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new kinds of <strong>Spells</strong> to make your attacks even spicier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill out Margot's <strong>Wardrobe</strong> and customize your <strong>Spell Box</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/Upgrades.gif?t=1751241347\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What a drag!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get <i>lost-in-the-box</i> as you're dragged into the experience of <strong>Draggin'!</strong> Enjoy the charming pixel aesthetics as you explore each environment, outfit your mouse in some rad regalia, power through <strong>Challenges</strong> 'til you achieve it all, and jump in for <i><strong>just one more run!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/Challenges.gif?t=1751241347\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475110?t=1751241347","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475110?t=1751241347","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/ea4bd0e054115622198fdca5ee28f60cf97799dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751241347","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/ea4bd0e054115622198fdca5ee28f60cf97799dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751241347","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3694970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Look what the mouse dragged in!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click and drag to cast your <strong>Spell Box</strong> and capture waves of <strong>Draggins</strong>, but be careful! Your <strong>Spell Box</strong> is vulnerable to attacks. Dodge, weave, and swoop in for tactical blows, all while strategizing your ideal build.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover new types of <strong>Draggins</strong> in each locale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn <strong>Spells</strong> and drink <strong>Potions</strong> to power up as the challenge intensifies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475110/extras/DragBoxes.gif?t=1751241347\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It just keeps draggin' on!</h2><p